      <marc:subfield code="a">Pattinattar&apos;s Songs is a collection of Tamil poetry from the 10th century, showcasing the works of the esteemed poet Pattinattar. Known for his deep devotion to Saivism, Pattinattar&apos;s poems reflect his spiritual and philosophical insights, offering a glimpse into the rich literary and religious traditions of Tamil Nadu. This collection captures the essence of traditional Tamil poetry, providing readers with an authentic experience of the devotional and cultural expressions prevalent in medieval Tamil literature.</marc:subfield>
